        "id": "Q1",
        "answer": "The approval panel is `plan_panel` in `bt_page_req.py`, reached through `req_page`. `req_page` selects the `plan` tab from `?tab=plan` (or by default when `plan_status == \"review\"`), then calls `plan_panel(project, rid, plan, plan_status, token)` when `PLAN.md` exists. `plan_panel` renders only `PLAN.md` via `md(\"doc\", read(plan))`, plus the approve/changes form when status is `review`. The route is `bt_server.py` `do_GET`, which calls `req_page` for `/p/<project>/req/<id>`. The form posts to `do_POST`, which routes `action == \"plan\"` to `decide` and then `rounds.plan_decide`.",
